A link definition or an attribute line past a box's column opens on its authored base

```
- ::: box
    [r]: /u
  :::

see [x][r]
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div class="box">

    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>see <a href="/u">x</a></p>
```

```
- ::: box
    {.k}
    para
  :::
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div class="box">
      <p class="k">para</p>
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- ::: box
  [r]: /u
  :::

see [x][r]
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div class="box">

    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>see <a href="/u">x</a></p>
```
